ates that\n\n$$\n¬(A∧B)=¬A∨¬B.\n$$\n\nSo, the negation of \"$a<8$ and $a>2$ \" is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}¬(a<8\\text{ and }a>2) & ≡¬(a<8∧a>2) \\\\  & ≡¬(a<8)∨¬(a>2) \\\\  & ≡a\\ge 8∨a\\le 2 \\\\  & ≡a\\ge 8\\text{ or }a\\le 2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186529195 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186198258 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "c65d0713-5b7a-5559-bef7-7b238edc29ab" :knowledge-point/title "Negating a Disjunction Using De Morgan's Law"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2cef2098-fe1c-545c-be26-8fc1955f2fee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$n$ is not positive" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528415} {:answer/id #uuid "fbdfdaa8-a327-5c90-9137-05c30d019147" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$n$  is  positive" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528927}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2cef2098-fe1c-545c-be26-8fc1955f2fee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$n$ is not positive" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528415} :answer-field/id #uuid "50c5823e-acc9-5ba3-b5da-8fef0cf3a3a3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045494 :db/ident :answer-field.type/select} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528989} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b8f14c3d-82af-5e57-ba2d-fcf2283f952b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$m$ is negative" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528751} {:answer/id #uuid "e578d8a3-b9b1-555d-b1cc-057ab8e51385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$m$ is not negative" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528865}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e578d8a3-b9b1-555d-b1cc-057ab8e51385" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$m$ is not negative" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186528865} :ans